ol?p=1144430#post1144430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They can, but they're big risks to take on hunts, even with regular regeneration they're not as tough as werewolves.<br /> <br /> Plus you're not always going to have a pack of spirit-hunters who are going to be willing to hunt spirits for your food. It would be far easier and consistent to occasionally dabble in some humanitarianism.</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't need a pack with a spirit that can impart the Siskur Dah by influences.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-27T09:15:47-07:00","id":1144452,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1141969-tell-primal-instincts-and-essence-pool?p=1144425#post1144425\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wolfblooded can benefit from the Siskur Dah rite.</div> </div> </div> </div>Can they? The rite says all participating <i>werewolves</i> gain the condition.<br /> <br /> Plus, it's a wolf rite. Only pack rites affect the entire pack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","